1
00:00:12,264 --> 00:00:15,884
Tu veux vraiment partir un mois en Asie ?
Do you really want to go to Asia for a month?

2
00:00:15,984 --> 00:00:23,300
Oui. Le voyage coûte environ trois mille euros, alors je dois économiser.
Yes. The trip costs about three thousand euros, so I have to save.

3
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,228
Comment tu comptes faire ?
How do you plan to do it?

4
00:00:26,328 --> 00:00:34,964
D'abord, je dépenserai moins pour les sorties. Ensuite, je mettrai cent euros de côté chaque mois.
First, I'll spend less on going out. Then I'll put a hundred euros aside each month.

5
00:00:35,064 --> 00:00:38,228
Et quand tu auras assez d'argent ?
And when you have enough money?

6
00:00:38,328 --> 00:00:43,100
Dès que j'aurai assez d'argent, je réserverai mes billets.
As soon as I have enough money, I'll book my tickets.
